WEBVTT

00:22:26.788 --> 00:22:31.246
the alpha male is very aggressive and
persistent in societies around

00:22:31.246 --> 00:22:34.871
the world. There are a lot of people who
don't necessarily want to operate that

00:22:34.871 --> 00:22:38.079
way. Intimidation or dominance
is not their default.

00:22:38.621 --> 00:22:40.996
It's not perfectly aligned
with their value system.

00:22:40.996 --> 00:22:44.621
But they look up the hierarchy and
they see very influential,

00:22:44.621 --> 00:22:48.871
very visible role models doing it and
they think they have to follow suit.

00:22:49.663 --> 00:22:53.496
And I guess you spent so many years
interacting with world leaders.

00:22:53.829 --> 00:22:57.163
I'm interested in what you think it's
going to take to break the myth of

00:22:57.163 --> 00:22:58.163
the Alpha.

00:22:58.538 --> 00:23:01.746
Probably more women coming in